baselines/multiply/main.py is a port of the public Kaggle notebook
"MultiPly Beam Search Agent" by Kaggle user aristophanivan
(https://www.kaggle.com/code/aristophanivan/multiply-agent-best-940-lb),
released under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE in this folder).

It is used only as a local sparring agent for tools/league.py and is not
part of the submitted agent. The header of main.py describes how the port
differs from the notebook.
